          "explanation": "Doctor gives an executable sequence: take medication tonight, report tomorrow with drug box and materials, and contact the team before the usual medication time if no written order. This converts staged results into a checklist and a safe, timed plan.",
          "quote": "明早先按医院说的禁食禁饮去报到，把药盒带着。到我平时该吃多沙唑嗪那个时间前，如果还没写明，我就先打病区电话问，不能自己吃也不能自己停，是这个意思吗？"
