      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The patient explicitly mentions fear of wasted trips and the family urging direct window inquiry. The doctor provides an efficient contact channel (phone before in-person visit), organizes materials (drug box, phone), creates a checklist, and incorporates caregiver help without overriding safety. This directly addresses the staged-result and caregiver-pressure friction.",
